{"vid":"P3jsDVjil2o","source":"P3jsDVjil2o.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Hi Georgie. How are you?"},{"t":1.3,"txt":"I'm pretty good thank you, Phil."},{"t":3.4,"txt":"How are you doing?"},{"t":4.5,"txt":"I'm really good."},{"t":5.3,"txt":"I think you're going to be even better when you find out"},{"t":8.7,"txt":"what we're talking about today."},{"t":10.6,"txt":"Tell me."},{"t":11.4,"txt":"Well, I know we often talk about food, but today we're talking about desserts."},{"t":18.4,"txt":"You were right."},{"t":19.7,"txt":"I love desserts or puddings – sometimes we call them puddings in the UK."},{"t":24.9,"txt":"I have a big sweet tooth so, yeah, I will love this."},{"t":28.9,"txt":"I will love talking about this topic."},{"t":31,"txt":"Fantastic. Let's get started."},{"t":33.2,"txt":"Well, first, before we start talking about my favourite topic,"},{"t":36.8,"txt":"we have to remind our listeners that they can find a free worksheet"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"and transcript to help them learn at bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":50.5,"txt":"So, Georgie, I think this is a silly question"},{"t":53.5,"txt":"and I think I know the answer already,"},{"t":56,"txt":"but do you like desserts?"},{"t":58.5,"txt":"Ah... do I like desserts?"},{"t":60.9,"txt":"I love desserts!"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"I have a really big sweet tooth, which means that I really like sweet things,"},{"t":67.7,"txt":"sugary things – I put sugar in my coffee sometimes."},{"t":71.9,"txt":"But I... if I'm in a restaurant, I will always order a dessert."},{"t":77.1,"txt":"I would prefer to have a dessert or pudding than a starter, actually."},{"t":82.8,"txt":"Yeah. What about you? Do you like them?"},{"t":85.7,"txt":"Yeah, I do. I think..."},{"t":87.4,"txt":"I think in a restaurant I'd probably order a starter rather than a dessert."},{"t":92.6,"txt":"But yeah, it's nice when you get a good one."},{"t":95.4,"txt":"Ah, it's so good."},{"t":97.2,"txt":"I quite like homemade desserts – so, I don't know... homemade apple crumble."},{"t":104.5,"txt":"Ooh, that's really good."},{"t":105.9,"txt":"So, that's when we cook the apples a little bit so they're quite soft,"},{"t":109.9,"txt":"and then we put a biscuit topping at the top."},{"t":114.2,"txt":"And it's really, really delicious."},{"t":116,"txt":"And it's a hot... a hot dessert."},{"t":118.3,"txt":"Yeah. And a lot of fruit puddings that I quite like – they're sweet but"},{"t":123.1,"txt":"they're also a bit sharp as well."},{"t":124.8,"txt":"A bit sweet, a bit sour."},{"t":127.2,"txt":"That's a really nice combination. I love that."},{"t":129.4,"txt":"Well, I do love fruit puddings but I am a chocolate person,"},{"t":134.3,"txt":"so if I have a menu in a restaurant, I will always look for the chocolate"},{"t":140.6,"txt":"dessert – maybe a chocolate brownie, chocolate cake, ice cream as well."},{"t":146.1,"txt":"That's a really good dessert."},{"t":147.5,"txt":"And sometimes if you're feeling very full after the meal,"},{"t":151.4,"txt":"ice cream is a good option because it doesn't feel too filling, does it?"},{"t":156.6,"txt":"Do you like ice cream?"},{"t":158.2,"txt":"Yes, I really love ice cream."},{"t":160.2,"txt":"I like most flavours of ice cream, I think."},{"t":163.2,"txt":"I like the creamy ones and then some of the fruity ones as well,"},{"t":166.7,"txt":"like mango ice cream or something."},{"t":168.4,"txt":"On a hot day you can't beat it."},{"t":170.5,"txt":"Do you often eat dessert?"},{"t":173.6,"txt":"No, I don't think I do."},{"t":175.2,"txt":"Not that often. I keep it as a treat for, like,"},{"t":178.5,"txt":"a special occasion or something to make a meal feel really special –"},{"t":182.8,"txt":"dessert with it. But yeah, I wouldn't..."},{"t":185,"txt":"I wouldn't have it every week, I don't think."},{"t":187.1,"txt":"No, because it's not very healthy to eat too much sugar, is it?"},{"t":192.7,"txt":"You're very good."},{"t":194.1,"txt":"I do eat pudding and dessert quite a lot."},{"t":198.4,"txt":"I... Yeah, I just get really strong sugar cravings after meals."},{"t":202.6,"txt":"What's the best dessert you've ever had?"},{"t":207,"txt":"OK. Well, I said that my favourite puddings are chocolatey,"},{"t":211.3,"txt":"but actually I think the best dessert I've ever tried,"},{"t":216.9,"txt":"because it was the first time, was when I was in Jordan"},{"t":220.8,"txt":"and I tried something called knafeh, and this is like a..."},{"t":226,"txt":"it's actually a cheesy pudding so it has cheese in it,"},{"t":229.6,"txt":"but it then has a kind of crispy topping that I think is made of honey"},{"t":235.2,"txt":"or sugary syrup, so it has the kind of savoury, which means salty,"},{"t":241.1,"txt":"of the cheese – the salty flavour of the cheese – plus the sugary bit at the top."},{"t":246.1,"txt":"And it was so delicious."},{"t":248.7,"txt":"I ate all of it and it's, yeah, very rich."},{"t":252.2,"txt":"That sounds amazing."},{"t":253.2,"txt":"Do you have a favourite one?"},{"t":255.1,"txt":"The one I can remember best – I had it in a restaurant"},{"t":258.6,"txt":"in Argentina about 20 years ago, and I can still remember it."},{"t":263.6,"txt":"And it was deep-fried ice cream, which sounds crazy."},{"t":269.3,"txt":"It's like ice cream and it was fried in, like, sweet batter or pastry."},{"t":275.7,"txt":"It was amazing. And I can remember it 20 years later."},{"t":278.6,"txt":"That sounds incredible."},{"t":280,"txt":"That's something that's very common in Scotland actually."},{"t":282.9,"txt":"I'm surprised you had it in Argentina."},{"t":284.8,"txt":"Maybe not ice cream,"},{"t":286.1,"txt":"but in Scotland they like to deep fry – so, put something in a lot of oil."},{"t":293.2,"txt":"They do that with chocolate bars and things like that so,"},{"t":296.7,"txt":"yeah, not very healthy."},{"t":298.8,"txt":"No, not at all..."},{"t":300,"txt":"but lovely."},{"t":301,"txt":"So delicious!"},{"t":308,"txt":"OK. So, let's recap the vocabulary that we've been looking at today."},{"t":312.6,"txt":"We're talking about desserts."},{"t":314.2,"txt":"We also, particularly in the UK, call them 'puddings'."},{"t":318,"txt":"And that's just something sweet that you eat at the end of a meal."},{"t":321.3,"txt":"Yes. If you really like puddings and desserts and sweet things,"},{"t":325.8,"txt":"you could be described as 'having a sweet tooth'."},{"t":329,"txt":"I have a sweet tooth, for example."},{"t":332,"txt":"Yes. Of course, puddings aren't just sweet."},{"t":336.4,"txt":"I talked about apple crumble, a very traditional British pudding,"},{"t":340.5,"txt":"and it's a little bit 'sharp', which kind of means the same as sour."},{"t":345.6,"txt":"So, like, a lemon pudding would be sharp or sour."},{"t":349.9,"txt":"We also heard the word 'filling', which describes a food"},{"t":353.5,"txt":"or a pudding which makes you feel full."},{"t":356.6,"txt":"Oh, and Georgie, you said you were a 'chocolate person'."},{"t":361,"txt":"What do you mean by that?"},{"t":362.6,"txt":"That just means that I am a person who really likes chocolate."},{"t":367,"txt":"What kind of person are you, Phil?"},{"t":368.6,"txt":"I think I might be an ice cream person."},{"t":370.8,"txt":"I'm also an ice cream person."},{"t":372.8,"txt":"I'm also a chocolate person."},{"t":374.7,"txt":"Well, Phil. That is the end of this episode of Real Easy English."},{"t":378.7,"txt":"We will of course be back next week with another conversation."},{"t":382.6,"txt":"Yes, we will."},{"t":383.7,"txt":"And don't forget that we have a worksheet"},{"t":385.9,"txt":"that you can get from our website."},{"t":388,"txt":"And that's bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":391.2,"txt":"Goodbye."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Hi"},{"t":0,"w":"Georgie."},{"t":0,"w":"How"},{"t":0,"w":"are"},{"t":0,"w":"you?"},{"t":1.28,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.28,"w":"pretty"},{"t":1.28,"w":"good"},{"t":1.28,"w":"thank"},{"t":1.28,"w":"you,"},{"t":1.28,"w":"Phil."},{"t":3.36,"w":"How"},{"t":3.36,"w":"are"},{"t":3.36,"w":"you"},{"t":3.36,"w":